    "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Beta Access</h1><p>Border Clash is currently in Beta access and free to play for members of our community.<br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>What <i>our players</i> have to say about Border Clash:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>\u201cTechnologies and resources make the game less random. You can plan ahead and develop tactics that give you an edge. I like how competitive it is.\u201d</i><br></li><li><i>\u201cMore depth than Risk, but not complicated to learn the basics\u201d</i><br></li><li><i>\u201cI like that everything is happening at once -  had a little bit of thinking of what to do next\u201d</i></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outsmart your opponents</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467480/extras/87d54f6888d93f89281c95e3ae85058b.poster.avif?t=1726506963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467480/extras/87d54f6888d93f89281c95e3ae85058b.webm?t=1726506963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467480/extras/87d54f6888d93f89281c95e3ae85058b.mp4?t=1726506963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Easy to learn, difficult to master <br></li><li>Simultaneous turns require you to anticipate your opponents moves<br></li><li>Outplay your opponents with superior tactics</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your strategy matters</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467480/extras/eec7a0d498b2e687ec4fd41d0b6ef5b9.poster.avif?t=1726506963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467480/extras/eec7a0d498b2e687ec4fd41d0b6ef5b9.webm?t=1726506963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467480/extras/eec7a0d498b2e687ec4fd41d0b6ef5b9.mp4?t=1726506963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Research makes all the difference - Over 30 technologies give you distinct economic and military advantages<br></li><li>Carefully manage scarce resources and grow your economy<br></li><li>Try different strategies and develop your edge</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless re-playability </h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467480/extras/0ca59cd994d4872daf4bb2c6fc8cddd4.poster.avif?t=1726506963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467480/extras/0ca59cd994d4872daf4bb2c6fc8cddd4.webm?t=1726506963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467480/extras/0ca59cd994d4872daf4bb2c6fc8cddd4.mp4?t=1726506963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Games are fast - Simultaneous turns lead to faster pace, less waiting around<br></li><li>Games are deep - Randomised resources, various strategies, challenging opponents<br></li><li>Game are competitive - Train with strong AI players, then rise on the public leaderboard</li></ul>",
